              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katherine Foxworth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very delicious. I simply love Asparagus any kind of way they're cooked. I sprayed the pan with olive oil but I also used a couple drops of EVOO while I was mixing the Asparagus in the ingredients. Also, I sprinkled minced garlic on top of them after placing them in the pan. As a bonus I added sliced mushrooms and cooked them along too. It was very good. The downside: next time I will cut down on the salt. One teaspoon was way too much. Thanks Diane for the recipe.",
